alent</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["SquarePlay Games"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Medo","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"\u00c4ngstigende Inhalte","rating":"6","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"6","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"Coming soon"},"required_age":0,"reviews":"\u201cMonk Took Book promises a unique mix of memory, management, and action that\u2019s as quirky as it is atmospheric.\u201d<br>GameDaily<br><br>\u201c...a quirky memory game with elements of job simulation and a good dose of first-person action, though the game also supports a third-person camera. If you\u2019d like to organise, remember and retrieve books by fire light in a gothic monastic library, don\u2019t forget to wishlist this.\u201d<br>ComicBuzz<br><br>\u201cMonk Took Book is a delightful game about organising a library in an isolated monastery, which is complicated by the fact you have no idea what any of the books are about, and also the vicious roaming skeletons...\u201d<br>Many A True Nerd<br>","screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/223919e33639942660256d9507af45a323ed818c/ss_223919e33639942660256d9507af45a323ed818c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774629146","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/223919e33639942660256d9507af45a323ed818c/ss_223919e33639942660256d9507af45a323ed818c.600x338.jpg?t=1774629146"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/394d4bb79d2ace4931c89552b090aa4b089cce31/ss_394d4bb79d2ace4931c89552b090aa4b089cce31.1920x1080.jpg?t=1774629146","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4022090/394d4bb79d2ace4931c89552b090aa4b089cce31/ss_394d4bb79d2ace4931c89552b090aa4b089c